  "Home: study progress, goals and donations": { es: "Inicio: progreso de estudio, metas y donaciones", fr: "Accueil : progression d'étude, objectifs et dons", de: "Start: Lernfortschritt, Ziele und Spenden", ja: "ホーム：学習進捗、目標、寄付", ko: "홈: 학습 진도, 목표, 기부", zh: "主页：学习进度、目标和捐赠" },
